@host = http://localhost:3000

### Record usage
POST {{host}}/usage
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subscriberId": "SUB01",
  "callMinutes": 40,
  "smsCount": 10,
  "dataUsageMB": 1500
}

### Retrieve all
GET {{host}}/usage

### Filter by subscriber
GET {{host}}/usage?subscriberId=SUB01

### Invalid — should return 400 with multiple errors
POST {{host}}/usage
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subscriberId": "",
  "callMinutes": "40",
  "dataUsageMB": -5
}